				<div data-dce-title-color="#000000" class="elementor-element elementor-element-505c7c16 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="505c7c16" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" id="h-title" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">OOT</h1>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-14c16723 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="14c16723" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<p class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Illya Goldman Gubin, Teun Zwets, Pierre Castignola, Théophile Blandet, Audrey Large, BNAG, Forever Studio, Flora Lechner, Tim Teven, Flora Lechner, Max Milà Serra, Jung Han Jisu, Seongil Choi, Rino Claessens, ESTO, Lucas Maassen, Heimviladrich, Pepijn Fabius Clovis, Soft Baroque, Simon Hampikian, Chai Dienn, Arnaud Eubelen, Nicolas Zanoni, Minjae Kim, NICEWORKSHOP, Sisan Lee, Paulina Vasiliauskaitė, Valerio Arsenio, Tom Volkaert, Sho Ota, Jun Fujisaku, Mikelis Murnieks</p>				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-19a91f4b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="19a91f4b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-720c67f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="720c67f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-211a7875 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="211a7875" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Opening 18 Oct 2026, 18:00</h4>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f2d9b07 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="f2d9b07" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-222706b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="222706b7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">18 Oct – </h1>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6b28511d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="6b28511d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">25 Oct 2026</h1>				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6b228da e-con-full elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile e-flex e-con e-parent" data-id="6b228da" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-510ba00 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="510ba00" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e92d997 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="e92d997" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ba51e07 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="ba51e07" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Guest curators Teo Re and Sheyang Li return to Van Abbehuis during Dutch Design Week, this time in collaboration with Korean curator Meeseek. <em>OOT</em> brings contemporary objects into Eindhoven’s former courthouse, once designed to exert authority. In rooms where judges, witnesses, and defendants once sat, the architecture dictates the degree of respect that is commanded.</p>
<p>The waiting room holds the visitor in the moment preceding the hearing. The conference room displays test pieces, leftover materials, and experiments as evidence. In the courtroom, contemporary objects take the place of the original furniture and suggest the roles of judge, witness, or defendant. <em>OOT</em> invites visitors into an environment in which both the objects and the surroundings determine how authority is conferred.</p>
								</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4be056e e-con-full vh-media--normal  e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="4be056e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
